s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"High-priced work booked more recently has replaced the lower-priced projects awarded prior to the Section 232 tariffs being implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2020-01-06","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Seth Rosenfeld","x":"Is there any shift in buyer behavior as some of the key historic sources of imported material begin to dry up or face incremental tariffs?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2020-01-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"So, I think prices are starting to firm, and you will see the part of that scrap price increase that we've seen over the last couple of months start to make its way into the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2020-01-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Tumazos","x":"Or do you think that they're going to rise back with the Mexican action or $50 to $100 domestic price hikes with higher scrap prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2020-01-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"That's where our efforts are in 2020, and then, we'll always be looking for cost reduction.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2020-01-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"But there's not going to be the, I'll call it, huge cost reduction numbers like we were able to capture last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/06/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q2","e":"cmc","d":"2020-03-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"That higher price work booked more recently has replaced lower-priced projects awarded prior to Section 232 tariffs being enacted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/20/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q3","e":"cmc","d":"2020-06-18","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"I should point out, Mexico Department of Commerce ruled on the fact that Mexico was circumventing the 232 Tariffs situation by manipulating the straight bar and welding a hook on it and clearly trying to circumvent our trade regulations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/06/18/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q3-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2020 Q3","e":"cmc","d":"2020-06-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"Cost reduction also benefited from the operating flexibility gained through the 2018 acquisition.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/06/18/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q3-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"CMC 2021 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2021-01-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"Average selling price of downstream products declined by $42 per ton from a year ago as a result of the mix of works shipped, as well as the impact of the high-priced projects booked in the immediate aftermath of Section 232 rolling off our backlog.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/11/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CMC 2021 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2021-01-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"In order to maintain metal spreads, we have responded to rapidly rising scrap costs with several rounds of announced price increases on each of our mill products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/11/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CMC 2021 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2021-01-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"Selling prices for steel products from our mills decreased by $14 per ton on a year-over-year basis but did sequentially increase due to price increase announcements that became effective in the latter half of the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/11/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CMC 2022 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2022-01-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Barbara Smith","x":"But the strong market is allowing those -- the inflation to be passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/10/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CMC 2022 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2022-01-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"Results this quarter include a net after-tax benefit of 33.7 million, primarily related to a tax capital loss recognition on an international tax restructuring transaction, which took place in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/01/10/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q1-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CMC 2022 Q4","e":"cmc","d":"2022-10-13","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Timna Tanners","x":"I know in the U.S., definitely a 25% tariff still has a pretty big impact on many countries with section 232.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/13/commercial-metals-company-cmc-q4-2022-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"CMC 2023 Q3","e":"cmc","d":"2023-06-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"We are encouraged that this measure passed through the parliament in late May and is expected to be implemented on July 1st.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/11/commercial-metals-cmc-q3-2023-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2023 Q4","e":"cmc","d":"2023-10-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"We responded to the current market imbalances by reducing costs and rightsizing production and believe that others have done the same.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/12/commercial-metals-cmc-q4-2023-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2023 Q4","e":"cmc","d":"2023-10-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"We responded to these conditions by reducing production by roughly 25% to rightsize inventory levels and lower market supply.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/12/commercial-metals-cmc-q4-2023-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2024 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2024-01-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"I think it's important to say that, you know, as it relates to the price increase that we announced, which I think may be part of what you're getting at, the move-in scrap -- the price increase that we announced did not fully cover the move that we've seen in scrap.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/08/commercial-metals-cmc-q1-2024-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2024 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2024-01-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"The Polish long steel industry has responded to market imbalances by meaningfully reducing production and right-sizing inventory levels.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/08/commercial-metals-cmc-q1-2024-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2024 Q3","e":"cmc","d":"2024-06-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tristan Gresser","x":"Usually, we see scrap prices move higher, price hikes on long products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/06/20/commercial-metals-cmc-q3-2024-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2024 Q3","e":"cmc","d":"2024-06-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"And clearly, the -- a lot of the benefits of the business case were on the cost reduction that that ensued.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/06/20/commercial-metals-cmc-q3-2024-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2024 Q3","e":"cmc","d":"2024-06-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"We are reducing our guidance to a range of between 400 million and 425 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/06/20/commercial-metals-cmc-q3-2024-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2025 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2025-01-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"Results for the quarter include approximately 4.7 million in costs related to planned maintenance overhauls and a 1.2 million expense associated with early retirement and layoff costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/06/commercial-metals-cmc-q1-2025-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2025 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2025-01-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"We have -- as Paul noted in his remarks, we've been right-sizing the operation from a manning perspective.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/06/commercial-metals-cmc-q1-2025-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"CMC 2025 Q4","e":"cmc","d":"2025-10-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"These trends include investment in our nation's infrastructure, reshoring industrial capacity, growth in energy generation and transmission, the build-out of AI infrastructure, as well as addressing a U.S. housing shortage of 2 to 4 million units.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/16/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2025 Q4","e":"cmc","d":"2025-10-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"As noted on Slide 10 of the earnings presentation, over $2 trillion of corporate investments across AI, manufacturing, shipping, and logistics, and energy have been announced in calendar 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/16/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2025 Q4","e":"cmc","d":"2025-10-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Peter Matt","x":"Imports beyond those quotas would be subject to new higher tariffs, which are currently proposed at 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/16/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2026-01-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"…that emerging structural drivers, including investment in U.S. Infrastructure, reshoring industrial capacity, growth in energy generation and transmission, the build-out of AI infrastructure, as well as addressing a U.S. Housing shortage, will support construction activity over the long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2026-01-08","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"And in the revised safeguards, the quotas are reduced by 50% and the tariffs for being above the quotas are increased by 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2026-01-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"And that is taking into account the fact that we do expect to realize all of the November $30 price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q1","e":"cmc","d":"2026-01-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"And I think as we go into the back half, there has been a merchant price increase of $50 a ton, we should see a little bit of that in the second quarter, but really most of it is going to be in the back two quarters and any other pricing actions will really set us up for a strong back half of 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/15/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q2","e":"cmc","d":"2026-03-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"…drivers, including investment in U.S. infrastructure, reshoring industrial capacity, growth in energy generation and transmission, the build-out of AI infrastructure, as well as addressing a U.S. housing shortage, will support construction activity over the short, medium, and long term.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/26/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q2","e":"cmc","d":"2026-03-26","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"Remember, these levies are in addition to the Section 232 tariff assessment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/26/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q2","e":"cmc","d":"2026-03-26","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Matt","x":"Quotas are expected to be significantly reduced while the volumes over the quota will be subjected to a 50% tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/26/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q2","e":"cmc","d":"2026-03-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"Value in the backlog at the end of the quarter was up by high single-digit percent compared to February of 2025, which allowed for opportunistic price increase on new bookings in certain geographies and positions the business well ahead of the upcoming construction season.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/26/commercial-metals-cmc-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CMC 2026 Q2","e":"cmc","d":"2026-03-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paul Lawrence","x":"Bill, I would just add, you know, with respect to Europe, we are confident that because of the situation that Peter outlined on the call, that it is competitively better positioned, that we will be a